Package: aitracking
Type: Package
Title: Measure the Effects of AI Coding Using the GitHub API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("George", "Vega Yon", email = "g.vegayon@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3171-0844"))
Description: A lightweight pipeline to measure the effects of AI-assisted
    coding on software projects using the GitHub REST API. Retrieves commit
    histories (including lines added and deleted), issue and pull request
    activity, download and clone statistics, and the evolution of a
    project's size in lines of code by language. Provides a parsimonious,
    rule-based classifier to flag commits and interactions in which AI
    coding agents were involved, and base-graphics visualizations of
    project activity over time. API access is implemented with base R
    connections to keep dependencies to a minimum.
